title: '[[id:bf4c2010-1253-46c0-b65d-35d484eef955][the perspective switch: why each choice was made, and which were Jeff''s]]'
pid: eef0d82e-e427-467f-a38b-4d4b319ebe96
body: |2-
  Open it before changing anything about perspectives, or when Jeff
  answers one of the choices made for him there: whether the cycle lists
  every author or only those who change something, perspectives named by
  skgrepo and not by person, the containers folder a replaced root keeps,
  the cost of a press on a large view. It holds his words for the
  command, for recomputing the cycle at each press, and for the root too.
